{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Parallax is a top-down action metroidbrainia set in a dwarf galaxy doomed to be fully consumed by a black hole. While that fate lies far in the future, each lightspeed jump pushes time forward, bringing this world closer to its end one sector at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAVEL AT LIGHT SPEED</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the speed of light you may not experience time, but everything else does.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your destinations carefully.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INVESTIGATE AN INTERSTELLAR MYSTERY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a meticulously crafted sci-fi world. Each discovery paints the galaxy in a new light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ask questions, analyze your journey, connect the dots to carve your way forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a heartfelt narrative told through a memorable cast of characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRAVE A COLD UNIVERSE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the laws of physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face extreme environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat against attackers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORPH INTO NEW SHAPES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spaceship grows to integrate technology you find on your travels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new game-changing abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your dream all-purpose vessel, ready to take on anything.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4126870?t=1765828682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126870/8a2bdb0c7e1182ed760a2b4d40364ab2b5b7beb6/pa